**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.cache/
**/work/

# Version folders like cinder-v1.1.2 incidentally match LaTeX aux-file
# patterns (e.g. *.[1-9]) in the root .gitignore; un-ignore the folder itself
# (contents still subject to the exclude rules above, e.g. .venv/, __pycache__/).
!cinder-*/
